674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kboMGGujCPEQ7kNvwEfWf1v&_nc_oc=AdqG24YSeRkmttk6R7shRbnK2v_0dsjUkeThKhTJ6mIOupf8WOrBipwLZDF-7RzMbrg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af33icFPCSZAm7lVanFbMYkJXZTrvknEqv4Jq7BkL0SIZg&oe=69D7B859"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C6uOu5fTRukQ7kNvwG_GL4k&_nc_oc=Adrn_jkY8ANbVVvsY3ICFJgWwIRSJCTduc-TYuJo2htUZp1jCHHGZN6kI31txvq2Gyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3pUyiiK2b-l3sG40aFYqT_rko_RSkwTK4lcKGB60eNSQ&oe=69D788D6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mb3xP0Ug0EAQ7kNvwElO6FQ&_nc_oc=Adq_Ay2v6-uQn7isILunSrMbNLsPFJKCAKAiUo6xibm95Pst3AR6qecUlxp6oegfU0w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0fHfR8FjE5WGOcXwcswPlyaC05JpgB3XAilyV9ymnyBQ&oe=69D7BD31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip